<article class="env-lemma" id="0E8E">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0E8E">Lemma <span data-tag="0E8E">7.25.6</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a site. Let $U \in \mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C})$. The functor $j_{U!}$ reflects injections and surjections. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      We have to show $j_{U!}$ reflects monomorphisms and epimorphisms, see Lemma <a href="/tag/00WN" data-tag="00WN">7.11.2</a>. Via Lemma <a href="/tag/00Y1" data-tag="00Y1">7.25.4</a> this reduces to the fact that the functor $\mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C})/h_ U^\#  \to \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C})$ reflects monomorphisms and epimorphisms. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>